  "hypothesis": "Current-process attribution locates nested async-builder setup and selector/parser frames. Remove only the internal format-selector state machine for an immediately completed JPEG signature; forward the parser ValueTask directly. This can remove one start/await/completion per complete JPEG operation. Extra completed-prefix dispatch and a larger pending selector state can offset savings; sample locations are not phase-time shares.",
